{title: Dilbar Mere Kab Tak Mujhe}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m] [D] [F#m],        Dilbar mere kab tak mujhe
[F#m] [E],        Aise hi tadpaoge
[D] [E],        Main aag dil mein lagga dunga woh
[C#] [F#m],        Ki pal mein pighal jaoge
[F#] [B] [F#] [B],        Ik din aayega pyaar ho jayega
[D] [E],        Main aag dil mein lagga dunga woh
[C#] [F#m],        Ki pal mein pighal jaoge
[F#m] [B],        Sochoge jab mere baare mein tanhayon me
[E] [A],        Ghir jaaoge aur bhi meri parchaiyon mein
[E] [Bm] [D] [F#m],        Dil machal jayega, pyar ho jayega
[F#m] [B],        Dil se milega jo dil to mehak ne lagoge
[E] [A],        Tum meri bahon mein aake behek ne lagoge
[E] [Bm] [D] [F#m],        Hosh ko jayega, pyaar ho jayega
